But Aella refused to surrender. Heartbroken yet fiercely defiant, she abandoned the open heavens and plunged into the dark fissures. Transforming her gentle breezes into protective, howling gales, she now sweeps through the winding gorges. Whenever a voice breaks the silence, Aella catches the sound and hurls it against the gleaming walls. Kael’s trapped spirit awakens, singing the melody back to her—the echo, an eternal duet of defiance.

